        {
          "text": "Mpawo twakakwiilila Jehova Leza wabamatateesu, nkabela Jehova wakaswiilila majwi esu, wabona mapenzi esu akulemenwa kwesu abuzike bwesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.7",
