        {
          "text": "muleelede kwaamba kubusyu bwa-Jehova Leza wanu kuti, Ndagwisya cipanzi cisalalisya muŋanda yangu, ndacipa ba-Levi abeenzu abamucaala abamukabafu, mbubonya mbuli malailile aako ngowakandilailila. Nsikwe kutyola nuuba umwi wamilumbe yako, Nsikwe kuluba pe. ",
